					'		<div>'+
								
					'			<a href="https://www.blueletterbible.org/esv/gen/3/1/s_3001" target="BLB_NW">Gen 3:1 ESV</a> - <span class="vRef">1</span> Now the serpent was more crafty than any other beast of the field that the LORD God had made. He said to the woman, "Did God actually say, \'You* shall not eat of any tree in the garden\'?"'+
					
